    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #64748b;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2em;color:#1e5aa8;margin-bottom:12px;\">THE SPIRIT BEAR</div><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1e5aa8;\">General facts</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; It is a white bear belonging to the black bear family.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Its colour comes from an uncommon <strong>31</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Local people believe that it has unusual <strong>32</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; They protect the bear from <strong>33</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1e5aa8;margin-top:10px;\">Habitat</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The bear’s relationship with the forest is complex.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Tree roots stop <strong>34</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> along salmon streams.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The bears’ feeding habits provide nutrients for forest vegetation.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; It is currently found on a small number of <strong>35</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1e5aa8;margin-top:10px;\">Threats</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Habitat is being lost due to deforestation and construction of <strong>36</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> by logging companies.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Unrestricted <strong>37</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> is affecting the salmon supply.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The bears’ existence is also threatened by their low rate of <strong>38</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> .</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1e5aa8;margin-top:10px;\">Going forward</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Interested parties are working together.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Logging companies must improve their <strong>39</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> of logging.</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Maintenance and <strong>40</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> of the spirit bears’ territory is needed.</p></div></div></div>",
